      "text": "DEFECT TYPES:\n  Critical defects: cause immediate failure (short, open, wrong Vt)\n  Non-critical: don't affect functionality at first (may affect reliability)\n  Random defects: particles, contamination — distributed across wafer\n  Systematic defects: design-rule violations, process interactions — location-specific"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
