        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yield and Economics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DEFECT DENSITY D₀:\n  D₀ = total critical defects per unit area (defects/cm²)\n  Modern leading-edge: D₀ ≈ 0.05-0.5 defects/cm² (depending on process maturity)\n  New process introduction: D₀ may start at 2-5 defects/cm²"
    },
