        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yield and Economics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. MURPHY'S MODEL (1964, industry standard):\n   Y = [(1 - e^(-D₀·A)) / (D₀·A)]²\n   Accounts for: defect clustering (Gaussian distribution of defect density)\n   Better fit to real data; widely used for yield projection"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md#019",
      "path": [
        "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics, git-history:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics]",
        "canonical_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[yield, economics]",
        "current_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:semiconductor-manufacturing:yield-economics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[yield, economics]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yield and Economics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. SEEDS MODEL:\n   Y = 1 / (1 + D₀·A)\n   Simple form; good for early yield estimate"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md#020",
      "path": [
        "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics, git-history:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics]",
        "canonical_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md",
        "concepts": "[yield, economics]",
        "current_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:semiconductor-manufacturing:yield-economics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[yield, economics]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yield and Economics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "4. NEGATIVE BINOMIAL MODEL (more accurate):\n   Y = (1 + D₀·A/α)^(-α)\n   α = clustering parameter (α→∞ → Poisson; α small → highly clustered)\n   Widely used by yield engineers, fits real data well"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md#021",
      "path": [
        "08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics, git-history:semiconductor-manufacturing:08-yield-economics]",
        "canonical_path": "semiconductor-manufacturing/08-YIELD-ECONOMICS.md",
