        "root_concepts": "[yield, economics]",
        "section": "semiconductor-manufacturing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Yield and Economics - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIE AREA vs DPW TABLE (300 mm wafer, 3 mm edge):\n  A_die    Gross DPW    Edge-corrected DPW\n  ─────────────────────────────────────\n  0.1 cm²  ~7,000       ~6,800\n  0.5 cm²  ~1,400       ~1,300\n  1.0 cm²  ~700         ~630\n  2.0 cm²  ~350         ~300\n  4.0 cm²  ~175         ~145\n  8.0 cm²  ~87          ~70\n  15 cm²   ~47          ~38\n  35 cm²   ~20          ~16   (H100 die)\n  50 cm²   ~14          ~11   (theoretical maximum reticle = 26×33 mm ≈ 8.6 cm²)"
    },
